# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# The checks under .github/scripts/ are run, not imported - but testing one
# means importing it from outside the repository, and Python leaves this behind
# next to the file it imported.
__pycache__/

# Notes to self, and nothing the site needs to run: the research behind each
# feature, a sweep of everything the GW2 API can return, and the working copies
# of the Apps Script code that runs in Google rather than here. Also where the
# full-size image originals live - git keeps every byte forever, so the 4 MB
# versions stay out and only the cut-down file in site/assets/ goes in.
_source

# The local test bench for the teams notice: a copy of the page with a control
# panel bolted on, twelve situations and a verdict for each. Useful and never
# shipped - it exists to exercise a strip that is only on screen four days a
# month. Ignored here rather than in .git/info/exclude so a fresh clone cannot
# commit it by accident.
_teste

# Working notes and saved prompts for whoever is helping with the code, kept
# out because this repository is public and anyone cloning it points their own
# tools at it. What a contributor needs is in CONTRIBUTING.md, on purpose.
# No trailing slash on these and the two above: where they are symlinks rather
# than folders, a pattern ending in '/' does not match them.
CLAUDE.md
.claude
